Source: linux-mst-hdr-meta
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @DEBFULLNAME@ <@DEBEMAIL@>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: linux-mst-hdr
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 linux-image-unsigned-@KERNEL_RELEASE@ (= @CUSTOM_VERSION@),
 linux-modules-@KERNEL_RELEASE@ (= @CUSTOM_VERSION@),
 linux-headers-@KERNEL_RELEASE@ (= @CUSTOM_VERSION@),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Experimental Intel HDR-over-DP-MST kernel
 Tracks the complete Ubuntu generic kernel carrying the experimental Intel
 HDR-over-DP-MST backport. This package is not supported by Canonical.

